20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Bluetooth Remote Control</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>User Manual</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-4 py-3 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>Tool Kit</li></ul></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-delivery" id="_R_hl_-panel-delivery" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground"><p>Free UK mainland delivery on all XSTO wheelchairs. Typically arrives within 3–4 working days.</p><p>Warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts, and 1 year on the battery. Bentech Medical Ltd manages all UK warranty claims as the official distributor.</p></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm"><a href="/pages/returns" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Read our returns policy</a> · <a href="/pages/warranty" class="font-semibold text-gold hover:underline">Warranty information</a></p></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-faq" id="_R_hl_-panel-faq" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card shadow-soft"><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What makes the M4 Pro different from the standard M4?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 Pro is the premium edition featuring a 150 kg weight capacity (vs 115 kg), 26 km range (vs 15 km), 0–20° electric seat tilt, 135° backrest recline, integrated LED turn signals and brake lights, 85 mm obstacle clearance, and a 450–730 mm adjustable seat height for standing-desk compatibility.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can the M4 Pro handle slopes and uneven terrain?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The M4 Pro handles slopes up to 15° safely thanks to its self-balancing gyroscopic system. It also manages grass, packed sand, gravel, and uneven pavements. The 85 mm obstacle clearance lets it roll over door thresholds and small kerbs.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How long does the M4 Pro battery last?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 Pro provides up to 26 km (16 miles) per charge under normal use. A full recharge takes approximately 6 hours. The battery is removable for easy replacement or charging off the chair.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Is the M4 Pro foldable for transport?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The M4 Pro features one-button electric folding and can be disassembled into modules for car transport. The heaviest single part weighs approximately 28 kg, making it manageable for most people to lift into a vehicle boot.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How soon can I receive the M4 Pro after ordering?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Within the UK: 3–4 working days with free delivery to mainland addresses. For Scottish Highlands, Northern Ireland, and offshore islands, please contact us for delivery timescales. A tracking number will be emailed after dispatch.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">What warranty comes with the M4 Pro?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The M4 Pro is covered by the standard XSTO manufacturer warranty: 5 years on the frame and base seat structure, 1 year on electrical and mechanical parts (motors, controller, etc.), and 1 year on the battery. Free UK mainland delivery is included, and our customer support team is available on 020 8050 4849.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Can I claim VAT relief on the M4 Pro?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. If you have a long-term illness or disability, you can purchase the M4 Pro VAT-free. Simply complete a VAT exemption declaration during checkout.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">Does the M4 Pro have LED lights?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. The M4 Pro features an integrated LED safety system with turn signals, brake lights, and ambient lighting for enhanced visibility when driving in low-light conditions or on roads.</p></details><details class="group px-5 py-4 md:px-6"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none font-medium text-foreground marker:content-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">How do I make a warranty claim?<span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border text-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></span></summary><p class="mt-3 pb-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Contact our UK support team at sales@bentechmeduk.com or call 020 8050 4849 with your order number and a short description (photo or video where possible). As the official UK distributor, Bentech Medical Ltd manages all warranty claims directly with the manufacturer on your behalf — no need to ship anything overseas.</p></details></div></div><div aria-labelledby="_R_hl_-tab-videos" id="_R_hl_-panel-videos" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="space-y-3"><div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-secondary shadow-soft"><iframe loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowFullScreen="" class="size-full border-0 object-contain" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/R2eyc-2uYNQ" title="Watch the M4 Pro in Action"></iframe></div><p class="font-medium text-foreground">Watch the M4 Pro in Action</p></div></div></div></div></section>{% render 'mr-product-related', current: product.handle %}</div><section aria-labelledby="product-app-download-heading" class="border-t border-border/40 bg-gradient-to-b from-background to-cream/40 pb-12 pt-14 md:pb-16 md:pt-20"><div class="xsto-container"><div class="grid items-end gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16"><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl" id="product-app-download-heading">Download the XSTO App</h2><p